    "scenesThatPass": [
      "SHERIFF LUND: Don’t play dumb. Not a chance in Hell I’m letting you out of this room tonight.\nLIV: You can’t keep me here forever.\nSHERIFF LUND: Try me. As Sheriff of this town, I have authority over everyone in it. As your legal guardian, I pretty much own your ass.\nLIV: You’re not my mom. I’m 18.",
      "LIV: There was an opportunity, I took it.\nKATHY: Well, I for one am glad you shit the bed, ‘cause I wanna watch the bitch burn.",
      "SIREN SARA: You’re cool. Let’s be besties.\nLIV: Uh, not today girlfriend.\nSIREN SARA: Sisters before misters. Girl power every hour!\nSIREN SARA: I’m gonna eat you out. Inside out, that is!",
      "LIV: There are reports that the creatures move on their own...\nLIV: Say things that are not programmed to...\nSIREN SARA: Wanna fuck, fatty?",
      "LIV: Is that what you did to my parents?! You monster!\nSHERIFF LUND: Quiet.\nLIV: You bitch, you killed --"
    ]
